[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13860.15, "timestamp": "03:51:00", "text": "好了，我干掉了一个炮弹。呃，就是这个东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13861.429, "timestamp": "03:51:01", "text": "等等，等等，别打造长矛。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13864.389, "timestamp": "03:51:04", "text": "需要它。我需要，我需要自己去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13867.83, "timestamp": "03:51:07", "text": "那个东西？是啊，我去杀几个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13871.55, "timestamp": "03:51:11", "text": "螃蟹是我的目标，这东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13875.59, "timestamp": "03:51:15", "text": "结束。嘿，小时候的我。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13881.59, "timestamp": "03:51:21", "text": "担忧。我有一个盾牌。有人有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13884.95, "timestamp": "03:51:24", "text": "有蟹壳吗？所以你可以喜欢你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13887.59, "timestamp": "03:51:27", "text": "盾。我愿意。我愿意。打造你的盾牌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13890.229, "timestamp": "03:51:30", "text": "很快。我可以做到。我能做到。我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13893.83, "timestamp": "03:51:33", "text": "给我挑战。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13895.429, "timestamp": "03:51:35", "text": "不，是为了我们的诉讼。你已经足够了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13897.429, "timestamp": "03:51:37", "text": "贝壳，对吧？我可以自己做一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13902.87, "timestamp": "03:51:42", "text": "有四个壳。我做它是为了造成破坏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13906.63, "timestamp": "03:51:46", "text": "开始了。汤。我们明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13908.55, "timestamp": "03:51:48", "text": "多尔曼精神。我该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13910.79, "timestamp": "03:51:50", "text": "钻石精神？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13913.91, "timestamp": "03:51:53", "text": "我们会拿到的。不用担心。我们会拿到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13916.71, "timestamp": "03:51:56", "text": "古代残片。这是一场冒险。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13918.389, "timestamp": "03:51:58", "text": "我们也会收到那一个。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13919.83, "timestamp": "03:51:59", "text": "担心。我们会收到很多。"}]